/-!
# Marked field sections of the Hermitian tensor image

The full centralizer of the field swap in the binary image is identified
with SL₃(F). Its inherited actions on the moved space, the middle quotient
and the top quotient are faithful and three-dimensional. Under the explicit
normalizer-coverage hypothesis, the relative pointwise centralizer of the
fixed space is the marked involution group.
Source: Aschbacher–Smith, H.4.4(6), printed pp.380–381.
-/
